{"cluster_id": "C-2824", "topic": "The liveness gate is a token-guarded", "target": "architecture/mounts-and-leases", "member_ids": ["B014-053"], "canonical_claim": "The liveness gate is a token-guarded slot claim on the same path as S13 self-remount: a live member refuses the operation, there is no FORCE variant, and the scope is the whole srid rather than a table.", "issue_ids": ["B200", "S13"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-cas-pool-member-decommission-design.md#decisions"]}
