{"cluster_id": "C-2835", "topic": "The implemented v2 design rejects rescue", "target": "architecture/mounts-and-leases", "member_ids": ["B024-107"], "canonical_claim": "The implemented v2 design rejects rescue of ambiguous renewals: a lease holder that cannot confirm its renewal is treated as not live, fenced, and self-remounted with a fresh epoch.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-24-cas-mount-lease-self-race-fix-v2-design.md#L1-L42"]}
